M THE POSITIVE PHASE 3 MONARCHE TRIAL EVALUATING VERZENIO, A CDK4/6 INHIBITOR, IN A SUBGROUP OF PATIENTS WITH HORMONE RECEPTOR-POSITIVE (HR+), HUMAN EPIDERMAL GROWTH FACTOR RECEPTOR 2-NEGATIVE (HER2-) HIGH RISK EARLY BREAST CANCER (EBC) WHO HAD RECEIVED NEOADJUVANT CHEMOTHERAPY.'}{'symbol': 'LUMN', 'date': '2021-06-04 12:17:00', 'title': 'BLACK LOTUS LABS UNCOVERS HACKTIVIST CAMPAIGN THAT USED A MISCONFIGURED ROUTER TO SPREAD AN ANTI-GOVERNMENT MANIFESTO', 'text': 'DENVER, JUNE 4, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BLACK LOTUS LABS®, THE THREAT INTELLIGENCE ARM OF\xa0LUMEN TECHNOLOGIES\xa0(NYSE: LUMN), RECENTLY UNCOVERED A HACKTIVIST CAMPAIGN THAT LEVERAGED MISCONFIGURED ROUTERS AND SWITCHES TO DISTRIBUTE AN ANTI-GOVERNMENT MANIFESTO. MORE THAN 18,000 DEVICES WORLDWIDE ARE STILL EXPOSED TO THE POTENTIAL ABUSE.'}{'symbol': 'TAP', 'date': '2021-06-04 13:00:00', 'title': 'ERIC GUNNING APPOINTED CORPORATE SECRETARY OF MOLSON COORS BEVERAGE COMPANY', 'text': 'GOLDEN, COLO. & MONTREAL--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MOLSON COORS BEVERAGE COMPANY ANNOUNCED ERIC GUNNING HAS BEEN APPOINTED CORPORATE SECRETARY, IN ADDITION TO HIS ROLE AS DEPUTY CHIEF LEGAL OFFICER.'}{'symbol': 'MDLZ', 'date': '2021-06-04 15:42:00', 'title': "TODAY'S NEWS REVEALS UFOS ARE IN THE SKIES ABOVE AND OREO, EARTH'S FAVORITE COOKIE, IS MAKING AN OFFERING OF MILK AND COOKIES TO ALL WHO ARE 'OUT THERE'", 'text': 'EAST HANOVER, N.J., JUNE 4, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ON A MISSION TO BRING ALL LIFE FORMS TOGETHER AND TREAT THEM TO EARTH\'S FAVORITE COOKIE, OREO IS MAKING AN "OFFERING" OF ITS FAMOUS DOUBLE STUF COOKIES TO WELCOME ALL UFOS, AND IS ENCOURAGING OTHERS TO GET IN ON THE FUN.'}{'symbol': 'REGN', 'date': '2021-06-04 07:00:00', 'title': 'FDA AUTHORIZES LOWER 1,200 MG INTRAVENOUS AND SUBCUTANEOUS DOSE OF REGEN-COV™ (CASIRIVIMAB AND IMDEVIMAB) ANTIBODY COCKTAIL TO TREAT PATIENTS WITH COVID-19', 'text': 'TARRYTOWN, N.Y., JUNE 4, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 EUA SUPPORTED BY PIVOTAL PHASE 3 DATA SHOWING 1,200 MG DOSE REDUCED RISK OF HOSP